---
title: "Mid-Build Sense Consultation"
scope: feature
phase: 2
feature: 11
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant MC as Motor Cortex
    participant TH as Thalamus
    participant S as Sense
    participant U as User

    Note over MC: Building... hits ambiguity<br/>in the specification

    MC->>TH: BuildQuestion<br/>"Should X or Y?"<br/>+ buildContext + targetDimension

    alt Dimension matches a sense (stake >= 0.3)
        TH->>TH: Route by dimension match<br/>or highest-stake sense
        TH->>S: SenseQuestionBriefing<br/>question + original perspective<br/>+ task context
        S->>TH: Targeted answer<br/>from this dimension's perspective
        TH->>MC: BuildAnswer<br/>source: sense
    else No sense can answer
        TH->>U: Escalate question<br/>(via PNS)
        U->>TH: Human answer
        TH->>MC: BuildAnswer<br/>source: user
    end

    Note over MC: Resumes building<br/>with the answer

    Note over MC,U: NE modulates question threshold:<br/>High NE = ask more (unfamiliar territory)<br/>Low NE = make the call (calibrated builder)
